# Feature Specification: Mobile App for Care Coordinators

**Status:** Proposed
**Priority:** Medium
**Target Release:** H2 2026

## Overview

Develop a mobile app that allows care coordinators to access key MedSync Platform features on the go.

## Key Features

- View patient lists and status
- Receive push notifications for critical alerts
- Update patient care plans
- Communicate with care team members

## Technical Considerations

- Native iOS and Android apps
- Offline mode for viewing patient data
- Biometric authentication

## Success Metrics

- 50% of care coordinators adopt the mobile app within 6 months
- Reduction in time to respond to critical alerts
